          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple shows this message for every keyboard that asks for Full Access. It is all or nothing: iOS offers no partial access." : {
      "comment" : "Full Access explainer sheet subtitle, above the drawn Apple alert (#704).",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple zeigt diese Meldung für jede Tastatur, die vollen Zugriff anfordert. Es heißt alles oder nichts: iOS bietet keinen teilweisen Zugriff."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple muestra este mensaje para todos los teclados que piden acceso total. Es todo o nada: iOS no ofrece acceso parcial."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple affiche ce message pour tous les claviers qui demandent l’accès complet. C’est tout ou rien : iOS ne propose pas d’accès partiel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple then downloads its model, sometimes for a long time. Dictus checks again when you come back." : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding Apple Intelligence step (#683). Footnote: no duration is promised, and the app re-checks on return.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple lädt dann sein Modell, manchmal recht lange. Dictus prüft erneut, wenn du zurückkommst."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Después, Apple descarga su modelo, a veces durante bastante tiempo. Dictus vuelve a comprobarlo cuando regresas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple télécharge ensuite son modèle, parfois longtemps. Dictus revérifie à votre retour."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At step 3, Apple will show an alert, the same for every keyboard." : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding keyboard step, under the drawn Settings page: warns that the Full Access alert is coming, before the Why Full Access? link (#704). Step 3 is the drawn Full Access switch.",
      "localizations" : {
