            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "OK"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don’t Allow" : {
      "comment" : "Drawn copy of the iOS Full Access alert's refuse button, in the Full Access explainer sheet (#704). Apple's own wording.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nicht erlauben"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No permitir"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Refuser"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Full access allows the developer of this keyboard to transmit anything you type, including things you have previously typed with this keyboard. This could include sensitive information such as your credit card number or street address." : {
      "comment" : "Drawn copy of the message of the iOS Full Access alert, in the Full Access explainer sheet (#704). Apple's own wording, copied from iOS 26.5: keep it identical to what iOS shows.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Voller Zugriff erlaubt dem Entwickler dieser Tastatur, alles zu übertragen, was du eingibst, auch was du zuvor mit dieser Tastatur eingegeben hast. Dazu können vertrauliche Informationen wie deine Kreditkartennummer oder deine Adresse gehören."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El acceso total permite al desarrollador de este teclado transmitir todo lo que escribas, incluido lo que hayas escrito anteriormente con este teclado. Esto podría incluir información confidencial, como el número de tu tarjeta de crédito o tu dirección."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L’accès complet permet au développeur de ce clavier de transmettre toute votre saisie, notamment celle effectuée précédemment sur ce clavier. Ceci peut inclure des informations sensibles telles que des numéros bancaires ou votre adresse postale."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit" : {
      "comment" : "Button that turns a list into edit mode, as iOS words it: drawn in the onboarding's voice notes and vocabulary scenes (#680).",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
