    "Hello Mrs Kowalczyk, I'm confirming our appointment on Tuesday at 10 a.m." : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding history scene: a saved dictation. Must NOT contain the searched word 'dentist' (#680).",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Guten Tag Frau Kowalczyk, ich bestätige unseren Termin am Dienstag um 10 Uhr."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Buenos días, señora Kowalczyk, le confirmo nuestra cita del martes a las 10."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bonjour Madame Kowalczyk, je vous confirme notre rendez-vous de mardi à 10 heures."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hi! Yes, we're still having dinner together tonight. I booked a table at Nonna's for 7:30, but my train is running about ten minutes late." : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding history scene: a saved dictation, today. Must NOT contain the searched word 'dentist' (#680).",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hi! Ja, wir essen heute Abend immer noch zusammen. Ich habe bei Nonna für 19:30 Uhr reserviert, aber mein Zug hat etwa zehn Minuten Verspätung."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¡Hola! Sí, seguimos cenando juntos esta noche. Reservé mesa en Nonna para las 19:30, pero mi tren va unos diez minutos tarde."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Coucou ! Oui, on dîne toujours ensemble ce soir. J’ai réservé chez Nonna pour 19 h 30, mais mon train a une dizaine de minutes de retard."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold the mic, slide to a mode, let go. Dictus writes in that mode." : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding Smart Modes scene: the line under the title, describing the long-press gesture on the keyboard's mic (#679).",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Halte das Mikrofon gedrückt, wische zu einem Modus, lass los. Dictus schreibt in diesem Modus."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mantén pulsado el micrófono, desliza hasta un modo y suelta. Dictus escribe en ese modo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gardez le doigt sur le micro, glissez jusqu’au mode, relâchez. Dictus écrit dans ce mode."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'll be there in ten minutes." : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding Smart Modes scene: the short sentence dictated in the drawn keyboard, shown as dictated, then translated by the → EN or → FR Smart Mode. Natural spoken message (#679).",
      "localizations" : {
