    "You have just seen them: pick three. They will be waiting for you when you hold down the microphone." : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding Smart Mode pick: subtitle under the title. It follows the Smart Modes scene (#677, #679).",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
